BT /F2 17 Tf 48 790 Td (01 | Introduction: what JAYTRIX does) Tj ET
0.04 0.18 0.42 rg 48 777 515 2 re f
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 757 Td 12 TL
(JAYTRIX SYSTEMS is a Tanzania-based technology solutions company. It helps) Tj T*
(businesses and organizations improve operations, customer experience, efficiency,) Tj T*
(information management and growth through appropriate technology services.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Our work starts with understanding the business problem. The right answer may be) Tj T*
(a website, a system, advice, an integration, security work, or no new software yet.) Tj T*
(We do not sell technology for its own sake. We connect a real need to a suitable) Tj T*
(solution, then confirm feasibility, scope, cost and timing with the technical team.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BUSINESS PROBLEM > UNDERSTAND THE NEED > DESIGN A SOLUTION > BUILD / IMPLEMENT) Tj T*
(> DEPLOY > SUPPORT > BUSINESS VALUE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Selling software means describing features. Selling a solution means understanding) Tj T*
(the client's work, explaining how a suitable service could help, and agreeing what) Tj T*
(will be delivered. Benefits depend on the client's situation and implementation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Service map: online presence and sales \(websites, e-commerce\); daily operations) Tj T*
(\(management, school, POS, stock, booking, automation\); access on devices \(mobile,) Tj T*
(desktop\); connections and foundations \(backend/API, integration, hosting, IT advice\);) Tj T*
(protection \(cybersecurity\); tailored work \(custom technology\).) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50 28 Td (JAYTRIX SYSTEMS | Internal Training Handbook) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 535 28 Td (3) Tj ET
endstream
