0.04 0.18 0.42 rg 48 777 515 2 re f
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 757 Td 12 TL
(NETWORKING - meet local business groups; target owners and managers. Opener: What) Tj T*
(process are you trying to improve this quarter?) Tj T*
(REFERRALS - ask a satisfied contact to introduce an appropriate business. Opener:) Tj T*
(Would you be comfortable introducing me to the person responsible for operations?) Tj T*
(WHATSAPP - use permission-based, personal messages; target known businesses. Opener:) Tj T*
(May I ask how you currently handle appointment requests?) Tj T*
(SOCIAL MEDIA - comment usefully, then message only when relevant. Opener: I noticed) Tj T*
(you take orders in comments; how do you keep each order organized?) Tj T*
(LINKEDIN - connect with operations, school, retail or business leaders. Opener:) Tj T*
(I work with JAYTRIX SYSTEMS and would value learning how your team manages [process].) Tj T*
(DIRECT OUTREACH - research before contacting. BUSINESS VISITS - ask for the right) Tj T*
(person and respect busy hours. PARTNERSHIPS - explore referrals with agencies or) Tj T*
(business advisers. EXISTING CONTACTS - reconnect with a relevant question.) Tj T*
(DIGITAL MARKETING - share useful service explanations; invite discovery, do not claim) Tj T*
(guaranteed results. Tailor each message, identify yourself and make an easy opt-out.) Tj T*
