0.04 0.18 0.42 rg 48 777 515 2 re f
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 757 Td 12 TL
(Protect client information. Do not misrepresent JAYTRIX capabilities or claim a) Tj T*
(fictional example is a real client. Do not promise technical features without) Tj T*
(confirmation. Do not give unauthorized discounts. Keep communication professional.) Tj T*
(Document important conversations and follow up consistently. Respect confidentiality.) Tj T*
(Escalate technical questions. Never guarantee results that cannot be guaranteed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POSITION: Business Development & Client Acquisition Representative) Tj T*
(RESPONSIBILITIES: find prospects; build relationships; identify business problems;) Tj T*
(present relevant services; generate qualified leads; coordinate with technical team;) Tj T*
(follow up; maintain relationships; support project acquisition.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(NOT RESPONSIBLE FOR: programming, architecture, implementation, technical guarantees) Tj T*
(or approving scope without the technical team.) Tj T*
ET
