(Proposed model: a representative may receive 40% of PROFIT from a project attributable) Tj T*
(to a client they successfully introduced, subject to agreed company rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLIENT PAYMENT - amount paid by the client. PROJECT COSTS - agreed direct costs of) Tj T*
(delivering the project. PROFIT - the amount remaining under the agreed calculation.) Tj T*
(COMMISSION - representative's agreed share of that profit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Example only: Client payment TSh 1,000,000; project costs TSh 300,000; profit) Tj T*
(TSh 700,000; 40% of profit = TSh 280,000.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Actual rules must be agreed and documented before commercial work. Define eligible) Tj T*
(introductions, cost treatment, payment timing, cancellations, taxes and approval.) Tj T*
(This example is not a promise of earnings or a finalized contract.) Tj T*
